# Submit in a multi-timeline position: Black has a mandatory board on every timeline, so the camera frames the present column
# (an Overview, zoom >= 0.6) instead of focusing one board. Misc - Time Line Battle (three timelines).
# Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250); row 7 of the mode list (905,524 after scrolling the list to its end); Play (808,712); Submit (841,90).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
move 905 400
wheel -4             # the list scrolls to its end (seven rows fit)
wait 10
click 905 524        # Misc - Time Line Battle (row 7)
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
clicksq 0 0 c1       # timeline 0: below zoom 0.8 the click brings the board up and picks the pawn
wait 30
clicksq 0 0 c2
wait 30
key HOME             # all three boards in view again
wait 40
clicksq 1 0 c2
wait 30
clicksq 1 0 c3
wait 30
key HOME
wait 40
clicksq 2 0 c3
wait 30
clicksq 2 0 c4
wait 30
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
camexpect state Overview
camexpect zoom 0.59 1.26
camexpect visible 0 1
camexpect visible 1 1
camexpect visible 2 1
capture camera-submit-multi-black
clicksq 0 1 e3       # Black's pawns: each click picks up and brings the board up (the zoom is below 0.8 on the first one)
wait 30
clicksq 0 1 e2
wait 30
capture camera-submit-multi-black-moved
